/P 208 0 R
/E (Solivita is a residential care home reimagining what senior living looks like when it's done with intention. Built for up to six residents in the Otay Lakes community of Southern San Diego, Solivita offers 24/7 personalized care in a home designed to feel like a breath of fresh air. Founded by a former state licensing investigator, every detail is curated to prove that this stage of life can be peaceful, purposeful, and full of connection. It's not a facility. It's a home where aging looks like living.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
