<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/E (Built from a deep understanding of what residential care requires and a vision to reimagine what it could be, Solivita is curated down to the smallest detail. Our six coastal-inspired rooms each have their own character, and every element of the home, from the dedicated care team to the enrichment programming designed around the seasons, the community, and the residents themselves, is selected with the same level of thought and intention. Because when you know what this industry looks like at its worst, you pour everything into making it look like its best.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
